{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>越秀地產上月合同銷售額，按年及按月均錄得升幅。</p><p></p><p>集團9月合同銷售68.1億元人民幣，按年微升，按月升幅逾兩成一。首9個月合計，合同銷售逾680億元人民幣，按年下跌近一成半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:03.757880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:11.580767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:11.580767+00:00","content_hash":"b199dabdcc6206a5260b83ec8deb3a6a5936cc268a5149664924c0656057ddb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}